@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5000

### List endpoints
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Comments (first page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments?limit=10&offset=0

### Comments (next page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments?limit=10&offset=10

### Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/summary

### By year
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/by-year

### By day
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/by-day

### Longest comments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/longest?limit=10

### Repeat commenters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/repeaters

### Languages (slow on first request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/languages
